, "id": "1418097086673734", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499308043_1418097090007067_7162940307610401612_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ABAzt4KW7RAQ7kNvwH5Dsbn&_nc_oc=AdqN_lwZ7NbYIkQa-UegDRYr_5nX4wf0XP7xMXJ_Yjdqop-XozXURdYQYcwZdNWqMDM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_-Q4CJ2JDprd5nYihLuMoa5Dh-inQE8wIgAzw5G8XzYg&oe=6A32AF60"}, "display_name": "Grab & Run | Alpaca Party", "keywords": ["hangout", "multiplayer", "action", "fighting"], "long_description": "\ud83c\udfae **Join our Discord \u2192 [discord.gg/fXzg8gwrpr]**\n\n---\n\ud83e\udd99 **Grab & Run!**  \n*The craziest VR Multiplayer Extraction Adventure is here!*  \nSquad up, loot hard, and make it out in one piece!\n\n---\n# \ud83c\udf92 How to Play? (STUPID SIMPLE)  \n**Loot \u2192 Fight \u2192 Extract!**  \n- \ud83d\udc8e **See it? Grab it!** Spot something glowing? Toss it in your cart and push like your life depends on it.  \n- \ud83d\udd25 **High Risk, High Reward:** The juicier the loot, the harder the escape. Go big or go home empty-handed!\n\n---\n{920559003901748}\n\n# \u2699\ufe0f Hilarious Physics! (Watch Out!)  \n- \ud83d\ude80 **Momentum is Real:** Push too fast and watch your loot (or your friends) go flying! Yes, you can literally \"cart\" your teammates.  \n\n{1425592372397818}\n\n- \ud83c\udfb2 **Teleport Pool:** The ultimate exchange. Sacrifice a flashlight, a monster, or a \"willing\" teammate to roll for a random weapon!  \n\n{923564353823246}\n\n- \ud83c\udf00 **Procedural Mayhem:** Maps change every run. Traps are everywhere, stay sharp!\n\n{1235048145507156}{1272848041041001}\n\n# \ud83d\udc7e Monsters & Level Up  \n- \ud83d\udc79 **Wacky Monsters:** Fight silly monsters and team up to beat the BIG BOSSES.  \n\n{1453318142995289}\n\n- \ud83d\udcaa **Evolve:** Collect coins to upgrade and make your Alpaca super strong! (In Dev)\n\n{1220327753504050}\n\n---\n\n# \ud83d\udd27 WE BUILD WITH YOU!  \n- \u2728 **Co-Creation:** We\u2019re fast. Tell us your wildest ideas on Discord, and we\u2019ll bring them to life!\n\n**Join the Herd:** [discord.gg/fXzg8gwrpr]\n{836496539475070}", "short_description": "This is Grab & Run, the physics-powered extraction multiplayer VR adventure where maps reshape every time, every stuff has real weight, monsters keep you alert, and an upgrade system makes each run hit even better, while you and your friends stay just the right amount of chaotic, new surprises drop all the time."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1G2lTbooVez5146G8ER7dBPNAw-xLTALwRUWbCwmp9j4/edit?usp=sharing", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Netvios", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://netvios.163.com/en/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "1700921480735423"}, {"id": "644354873106712"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": [], "id": "26501997622805117"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499620432_749436550827526_5464720052725749458_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JroJNKnrZu0Q7kNvwF1nc7f&_nc_oc=AdqtWCRh-FABl98UPv5dLtLXf_WOLdZKSdbWXH9Ljfy_ojEuaHC2BSA8Jz86OALISt4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-aC0mRcN0WLPFEIoKc8gHIqOeHfBzm59wchn0DOHeylg&oe=6A32C87B"}, "is_concept": fals